                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>The course targets the enhancement of the following skills:</p>
<p>1)Understanding the fundamentals of Obstetrics and Gynecology;</p>
<p>2)Relating this to the requirements of professional education for clinical competence;</p>
<p>3)Developing practical, generic skills in teaching and assessment, underpinned by an understanding of educational theory;</p>
<p>4)Promoting reflective practice in education and clinical practice;</p>
<p>5)Developing professional skills and attitudes;</p>
<p>The ultimate goal is to mastering the principle and strategy for Obstetric and Gynecologic Diagnosis and Treatment.</p></font></span><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;
